  "details": "Lets keep this short and sweet.\n-add steam account based agelocked content filters to protect minors. 18+ content should be permalocked on all meta devices. \n-add more content filters for sensory and ease of access\n-dont add eac for the love of god\n- fix avatar ripping and crashers\n-start either working with the modders or implementing the features on your own so modders dont have to improve the game for you\n-add disability, sensory, and hard of hearing support options.",
